# Demultiplexer (1:2)

## Goal

Learn how to build a 1-to-2 demultiplexer in Verilog and understand how digital systems route a single signal to different destinations.

## Concepts Learned

- module
- input
- output
- wire
- assign
- selection logic
- combinational logic

